---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use — ailocal.click"
  description="The terms for using the ailocal.click model directory, account features, and Copy & run guidance."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
  pageClass="about-page"
>
  <article class="about-shell">
    <header class="about-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms of use</p>
      <h1>Discover openly. Run deliberately.</h1>
      <p>Effective 24 August 2026. By using ailocal.click, you agree to these terms.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="about-row">
      <div><span>01</span><h2>What the service provides</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>ailocal.click is an independent directory and beginner guide for models listed in Ollama’s official library. It provides search, model pages, private saved lists, profiles, and visible Copy &amp; run commands.</p>
        <p>The service is not affiliated with Ollama. Model names, metadata, software, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-row">
      <div><span>02</span><h2>Your control and responsibility</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>The website cannot install software or execute Terminal commands. You decide whether to install Ollama, paste a command, download a model, and use its output.</p>
        <p>You are responsible for checking model licenses, system requirements, accuracy, safety, and suitability before use, and for complying with applicable law.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-row">
      <div><span>03</span><h2>Accounts</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>Provide accurate account information, protect your sign-in method, and do not misuse the service, interfere with security, scrape abusively, or attempt to access another user’s data.</p>
        <p>We may restrict abusive access when reasonably necessary to protect users or the service. You can stop using the service at any time.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-row">
      <div><span>04</span><h2>Accuracy and availability</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>The catalog refreshes automatically, but upstream metadata, model availability, tags, licenses, sizes, and requirements can change. Confirm important details on the linked official model page.</p>
        <p>The service is provided as available, without a promise that every feature, model, or external service will always be uninterrupted or error-free.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-row">
      <div><span>05</span><h2>Contact</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:corporate@agentmail.to">corporate@agentmail.to</a>.</p>
        <p>Material changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
